# Ohio Secretary of State county voter files: 80+ MB each, refreshed weekly,
# and they carry dates of birth. Download to SourceData/ and convert locally;
# only the derived react-app/public/data/voters.json is committed.
SourceData/SOS_*.txt
# A Board's raw export kept beside the converted CSV while testing a converter
# (always named with a hyphen: cuyahoga-boe-raw.csv, Stark-mailed-raw-<date>.xlsx).
# Not *raw* - that also matched "TuscaRAWas" and hid its absentee file (Oct 29 2026).
SourceData/*-raw*
